      "message": "[warning] Line 3648: 🟡 Incoming external-media calls can get duplicate `RemoteSdpReceived` notifications for the initial offer: once in `Manager::processIncomingCall` and again here on initial negotiation completion. This can make clients interpret the second emission as a new offer. Gate this path to re-negotiations (or suppress when the initial incoming offer was already signaled).",
