      "side": 1,
      "message": "[warning] Line 4407: 🟡 `VideoOrientationChanged` emits `getCallId()` directly, which is a subcall ID in forked/multi-device scenarios. Public call signals in this class usually normalize to the parent call ID, and clients track the parent ID from `IncomingCall`/`placeCall`. Emit `parent_-\u003egetCallId()` when `isSubcall()` to keep signal correlation stable.",
      "revId": "7a23a0fac714740d071a4b59ce78ca5c2713352d",
