      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 1384: 🔴 For external-media outgoing calls, remote SDP is captured only from `2xx` INVITE responses. SIP offer/answer allows the answer in reliable provisional responses (e.g. `183` with PRACK), and the final `200` may then contain no SDP; in that valid flow, `RemoteSdpReceived` is never emitted and the external endpoint cannot complete `setRemoteDescription`. Capture the first SDP-bearing INVITE response (provisional or final) once, instead of filtering to `2xx` only.",
      "revId": "7a23a0fac714740d071a4b59ce78ca5c2713352d",
